---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import ComingSoon from "../components/ComingSoon.astro";
---
<Base title="atHand: Your Info, Ready" description="atHand keeps your household’s reference information on your iPhone and suggests the right record when it can help.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Your info, ready when you need it</h1>
    <p class="lede">atHand keeps the details you look up all the time, such as people, vehicles, pets, homes, financial accounts, and contacts, in one place on your iPhone.</p>
    <ComingSoon />

    <h2>For the moments you need it</h2>
    <p>At the doctor’s office, at a traffic stop, or at the airport, you need a member ID, a license number, or a passport number right away. atHand keeps them on your iPhone, for you and the people, vehicles, pets, and homes you look after.</p>

    <h2>What it does</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Keep records for people, vehicles, pets, homes, financial accounts, and contacts, or make a custom record for anything else.</li>
      <li>Scan a driver’s license, passport, insurance card, VIN, vaccine record, or business card instead of typing. You check every field before it is saved.</li>
      <li>Get a suggestion for the record that is likely to help right now, based on the time of day and, if you allow them, your calendar and location.</li>
      <li>Lock atHand with Face ID, Touch ID, or your device passcode, and export an encrypted backup protected by a passphrase you choose.</li>
    </ul>
    <ul class="links">
      <li><a href="/features.html">See all features</a></li>
    </ul>

    <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="privacy-summary">
      <h2 id="privacy-summary">Privacy in short</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Your information stays on your iPhone. It leaves only inside an encrypted backup file that you choose to export.</li>
        <li>There is no account and no sign-in.</li>
        <li>atHand connects to Apple and RevenueCat for purchases, to Google for anonymous scanning diagnostics, and, if you allow location, to Apple to look up the name of a nearby place. It never sends your scans, photos, recognized text, or anything you enter.</li>
        <li>The developer added no advertising, tracking, analytics, or crash-reporting tools.</li>
      </ul>
      <ul class="links">
        <li><a href="/privacy-overview.html">How atHand handles your information</a></li>
        <li><a href="/privacy.html">Read the full privacy policy</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <h2>Free to start</h2>
    <p>Your own record is free. A one-time purchase unlocks everything else. There is no subscription.</p>
    <ul class="links">
      <li><a href="/pricing.html">See pricing</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
